# karr-foundation headless execution for p5-mcp-run.
# The board lives in refs/karr/*; this marker opts the repo into agent drains.
claude: true
prompt: >
  Work the local karr board for MCP::Run. Pick the highest-priority open ticket and
  delegate all behavior-relevant code to the mcp-run-worker agent rather than editing
  internals yourself. Verify with `prove -lr t/` (recursive; plain `prove -l t/` skips
  subdir tests). Serialize karr mutations — collect results, then loop the board writes
  sequentially. Never run `dzil release` or push to CPAN / Docker Hub, and never act on
  a public GitHub/RT issue on your own initiative. Stop when nothing on the board is
  actionable without a human decision.
